      "text": "Find an antiderivative.\n\n\u222b\n3\n50\n\ud835\udc65\n2\n+\n2\nd\n\ud835\udc65\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, \n\ud835\udc36\n is an arbitrary constant.\n\nChoose an answer\nIncorrect choice left unselected.\n\n\u2212\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n10\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\nIncorrect choice left unselected.\n\n15\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n2\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\nIncorrect choice left unselected.\n\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n5\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\nIncorrect choice left unselected.\n\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n10\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n10\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\n\u2713\nCorrect choice selected.\n\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n10\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\nCORRECT\nPreview only\nSolution:\n\nAnswer \u00b7 correct value:\n\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n10\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n\nLet \n\ud835\udc62\n=\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n. Then \nd\n\ud835\udc62\n=\n(\n5\n)\nd\n\ud835\udc65\n.\n\nNormalize the denominator:\n\n50\n\ud835\udc65\n2\n+\n2\n=\n2\n(\n1\n+\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n2\n)\n.\n\nThe differential is \nd\n\ud835\udc65\n=\n1\n5\nd\n\ud835\udc62\n. The outside factor is \n3\n2\n\u22c5\n1\n5\n=\n3\n10\n.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n\t\n\u222b\n3\n50\n\ud835\udc65\n2\n+\n2\nd\n\ud835\udc65\n\n\t\n=\n3\n10\n(\n\u222b\n1\n\ud835\udc62\n2\n+\n1\nd\n\ud835\udc62\n)\n.\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n\u222b\n1\n\ud835\udc62\n2\n+\n1\nd\n\ud835\udc62\n=\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n\ud835\udc62\n)\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n.\n\n3\n10\n(\n\u222b\n1\n\ud835\udc62\n2\n+\n1\nd\n\ud835\udc62\n)\n=\n3\n10\n(\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n\ud835\udc62\n)\n)\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n.\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n3\narctan\n\u2061\n(\n5\n\ud835\udc65\n)\n10\n+\n\ud835\udc36\n.\n\nBack to study \u2192",
